## Messages (Protected - requires Bearer token)

### Get all messages
curl -X GET "http://localhost:3000/messages" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ID_TOKEN_HERE"

### Get specific message
curl -X GET "http://localhost:3000/messages/msg-id" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ID_TOKEN_HERE"

### Send message
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3000/messages" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ID_TOKEN_HERE" \
  -d '{
    "job_id": "job-uuid",
    "sender_id": "user-uuid-1",
    "receiver_id": "user-uuid-2",
    "content": "Hi Alice, I loved your application! Can we schedule a call?",
    "message_type": "text"
  }'

### Mark message as read
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3000/messages/msg-id" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ID_TOKEN_HERE" \
  -d '{
    "is_read": true
  }'

### Delete message (soft delete)
curl -X DELETE "http://localhost:3000/messages/msg-id" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ID_TOKEN_HERE"

